# KeyQueue - Mythic+ auto-queue for the Premade Group Finder (Midnight S1)
# Sibling to KeyComp: KeyComp builds the group as the leader; KeyQueue finds and
# applies to groups as a seeker, and keeps auto-applying until you get invited.
# Interface for WoW Midnight 12.0.0.
